<title>USA: Shelby Williams completes Preview sale.</title>
<headline>Shelby Williams completes Preview sale.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shelby Williams Industries Inc said Tuesday it completed the sale of its Preview Furniture Corp subsidiary to Ferguson Copeland LLC for cash and notes.</p>
<p>Specific terms were not disclosed, but Shelby Williams said the sale will not affect its third quarter earnings.</p>
<p>The sale was part of the company's December 1994 restructuring plan, Shelby Williams said.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
